## Fork notice / Fork 说明

This repository (`0xtarotter/HedwigSMS`) is a community fork of the original
HedwigSMS by Haowei Cao (https://chwjh.com). The original copyright above is
retained. The following additions/modifications were made by 0xtarotter and are
released under the same MIT License:

本仓库（`0xtarotter/HedwigSMS`）是 Haowei Cao 原版 HedwigSMS 的社区 fork，保留上述
原始版权声明。以下新增 / 修改由 0xtarotter 完成，同样以 MIT 许可发布：

- SMTP email channel (Android direct mode + local relay)
- Keep-alive watchdog scheduler (auto-restart when killed)
- Power status notification toggle
- Bark-compatible `body` field in webhook payloads
- Version bump to 1.1.0

Copyright (c) 2026 0xtarotter (https://github.com/0xtarotter)
